{"id":"A2-L043","title":"Future: will — practice and contrast","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U03","focus":"Future — will — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Future — will — prática e contraste","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["sudden","evidence","step up","prediction","intention","overcast","gust","sudden idea","plan ahead","probably","definitely","certain","likely","unlikely","maybe","perhaps"],"field":"Saúde cotidiana","genre":"Transcrição de palestra e podcast","skill":"Fala","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 43 · Future: will — practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Future — will — prática e contraste.","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**10 palavras novas** (saúde cotidiana).","**Texto do dia:** transcrição de palestra e podcast."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contrastar will e going to numa palestra."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["sudden","repentino"],["evidence","evidência"],["step up","apresentar-se"],["prediction","previsão"],["intention","intenção"],["overcast","nublado"],["gust","rajada"],["sudden idea","sudden idea"],["plan ahead","plan ahead"],["probably","probably"],["definitely","definitely"],["certain","certain"],["likely","likely"],["unlikely","unlikely"],["maybe","maybe"],["perhaps","perhaps"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A lecture transcript","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Lecture: Will or Going To?","paras":["Good morning. Use **will** for sudden decisions: “The phone is ringing. **I’ll get it.**” Use **going to** for plans: “I **am going to study** tonight.”","For predictions, both work: “It **will** rain” or “It **is going to** rain.” With evidence, prefer **going to**: “Look at those clouds!”"],"kicker":"LECTURE TRANSCRIPT","by":"Prof. Ames","gloss":[["sudden","repentino"],["decision","decisão"],["evidence","evidência"],["ring","tocar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Will is used for sudden decisions.","ans":"T","why":"sudden decisions."},{"q":"Going to is for sudden decisions.","ans":"F","why":"plans."},{"q":"With evidence, prefer going to.","ans":"T","why":"prefer going to."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“sudden” = ?","opts":["repentino","lento","antigo"],"ans":0,"why":"sudden."},{"q":"“evidence” = ?","opts":["evidência","exemplo","pergunta"],"ans":0,"why":"evidence."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"will × going to","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Situação","Forma","Exemplo"],"rows":[["decisão na hora","will","**I’ll get it.**"],["plano prévio","going to","**I’m going to study tonight.**"],["previsão sem evidência","will","**It will rain.**"],["previsão com evidência","going to","**Look at the clouds! It’s going to rain.**"]],"cap":"will × going to"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**I’ll** = I will; **won’t** = will not."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The phone is ringing. I ___ get it. (will)","a":"’ll","why":"decisão."},{"s":"I ___ to study tonight. (be going)","a":"am going","why":"plano."},{"s":"Look at those clouds! It ___ to rain. (be going)","a":"is going","why":"evidência."},{"s":"I think it ___ rain. (will)","a":"will","why":"previsão."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["sudden","repentino"],["choice","escolha"],["evidence","evidência"],["buzz","zumbir"],["promise","promessa"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["get","it","I'll"],"ans":"I'll get it","pt":"Eu atendo."},{"words":["phone","is","ringing","The"],"ans":"The phone is ringing","pt":"O telefone está tocando!"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"sudden","pos":"word","pt":"repentino","ex":"A sudden idea.","expt":"Uma ideia repentina."},{"w":"evidence","pos":"word","pt":"evidência","ex":"Clear evidence.","expt":"Evidência clara."},{"w":"step up","pos":"word","pt":"apresentar-se","ex":"I step up.","expt":"Eu me apresento."},{"w":"prediction","pos":"word","pt":"previsão","ex":"A bold prediction.","expt":"Uma previsão ousada."},{"w":"intention","pos":"word","pt":"intenção","ex":"A good intention.","expt":"Uma boa intenção."},{"w":"overcast","pos":"word","pt":"nublado","ex":"An overcast day.","expt":"Um dia nublado."},{"w":"gust","pos":"word","pt":"rajada","ex":"A strong gust.","expt":"Uma rajada forte."},{"w":"sudden idea","pos":"word","pt":"sudden idea","ex":"ideia repentina","expt":"A sudden idea."},{"w":"plan ahead","pos":"word","pt":"plan ahead","ex":"planejar com antecedência","expt":"Plan ahead."},{"w":"probably","pos":"word","pt":"probably","ex":"provavelmente","expt":"It will probably rain."},{"w":"definitely","pos":"word","pt":"definitely","ex":"com certeza","expt":"I will definitely go."},{"w":"certain","pos":"word","pt":"certain","ex":"certo","expt":"I am certain."},{"w":"likely","pos":"word","pt":"likely","ex":"provável","expt":"It is likely."},{"w":"unlikely","pos":"word","pt":"unlikely","ex":"improvável","expt":"It is unlikely."},{"w":"maybe","pos":"word","pt":"maybe","ex":"talvez","expt":"Maybe tomorrow."},{"w":"perhaps","pos":"word","pt":"perhaps","ex":"quem sabe","expt":"Perhaps later."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**The phone is ringing!** — O telefone está tocando!","**I’ll get it.** — Eu atendo.","**Are you going to study tonight?** — Vai estudar hoje à noite?","